      "text": "• same packet → same output, no model in the loop\n• join processed authoritative counts.verdict (digest.py reads raw reward today)\n• show raw vs counted separately, never blended\n• SHOW spend vs ceiling, quarantine, verdict deltas (no new actions)\n• diagrams regenerate only when their inputs change",
